{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51692","headline":"题延和阁（《全唐诗》八七五作谶记，诗题、小序、诗多有不同，故重录）（时高骈欲继淮南王求仙方爲妖乱，後爲毕将军所害。隐作《妖乱志》以讥之，故有《题延和阁》云。） · 罗隐","name":"题延和阁（《全唐诗》八七五作谶记，诗题、小序、诗多有不同，故重录）（时高骈欲继淮南王求仙方爲妖乱，後爲毕将军所害。隐作《妖乱志》以讥之，故有《题延和阁》云。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"延和高阁势凌云，轻语犹疑太一闻。\n烧尽余香无一事，开门迎得毕将军。\n（《诗话总龟》三五《讥诮门》引《监诫录》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51692.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51692","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}